<!--
    res/values/themes_accent.xml  ──  LIGHT variants
    ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    6 Material 3 ThemeOverlay styles — light mode.
    Android picks this file automatically in day / light mode.
    Mirror names exist in res/values-night/themes_accent.xml.

    PRESET_DEFAULT (0) → no overlay — base app theme used as-is.

    Seed → tonal palette per Material Theme Builder 2025 spec.
    Backgrounds: #F8FAFC (near-white cool) or #FAFAFA (pure neutral).
    ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
-->
